OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran celebrates 107th birthday
OL,4,Awith sing-along
OL,5,
OL,6,FA World War Two RAF veteran marked his
OL,7,F107th birthday with hundreds of
OL,8,Fbirthday cards and a sing-along at his
OL,9,Fcare home.
OL,11,FHarold Hodgson, who was born in
OL,12,FDarlington on 7 November 1919, joined
OL,13,Fthe RAF when he was 22 and spent time
OL,14,Fin Belgium, France, Germany, the
OL,15,FNetherlands and Norfolk.
OL,17,FFollowing an appeal, more than 300
OL,18,Fbirthday cards were sent by both
OL,19,Ffriends and strangers to The Grange
OL,20,Fcare home in Darlington, whose staff
OL,21,Fthrew a celebration to mark the
OL,22,Fmilestone.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
