OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran celebrates 107th birthday
OL,4,Awith sing-along
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've done everything, I've let no
OL,7,Fgrass grow under my feet," Hodgson said
OL,8,Fof his age. "And I've lived and lived
OL,9,Fand lived."
